respond to it really fast.

00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:47.860
While each and every
one of this data

00:00:47.860 --> 00:00:51.430
becomes valuable for
retrospective analysis,

00:00:51.430 --> 00:00:55.670
time to respond in real
time is very limited.

00:00:55.670 --> 00:00:58.120
So you want to have
a platform that you

00:00:58.120 --> 00:01:01.690
can achieve both
of these, real time

00:01:01.690 --> 00:01:05.400
